linux-6.11-qcom (6.11+qcom-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * d/patches: enable sargo/bonito drivers.
    Those are currenty missing from our tree, but having those enabled in
    the defconfig is a first step towards supporting those devices.
    At the same time, ensure GPU/panels drivers (as well as DISPCC clocks)
    are built as modules as this seems to improve display reliability.
